  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment covers the costs associated with contracted advisory services provided by the Lead Specialist Climate Resilience and Water. The Lead Specialist Climate Resilience and Water provides technical and strategic expertise to support DFAT participation in design, administration, monitoring and evaluation and other ODA eligible operations of water security and climate resilience related investments and activities under the Mekong Australia Partnership Phase 2.</narrative>
